 "text": "Hi, how are you holding up? In some cases, yes. A good webcam can make a big difference in privacy and peace of mind. Then it' worth trying out for a week or two. You can use an app to switch between cameras mid-call, which is nice if the old one turns up again. Be aware that some manufacturers stop supporting older models with security patches. It can get lonely out there with no support. Then a small webcam that sits on top of it is probably the most useful kind. It gives your co worker eye contact without staring at a webcam all day.",
